<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>專業媒合服務 | 官方網站</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: '微軟正黑體', sans-serif; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }
        
        /* 頁首區域 */
        header { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; padding: 4rem 1rem; text-align: center; }
        
        /* 全寬視覺區塊 (素材應用) */
        .vision-section { 
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80'); 
            background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: white; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center; 
        }

        .section { padding: 60px 0; }
        h2 { text-align: center; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 40px; }

        /* 案例網格 */
        .case-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .case-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .case-img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; }
        .case-content { padding: 20px; }

        /* 懸浮按鈕 */
        .fixed-contact { position: fixed; bottom: 30px; right: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; z-index: 9999; }
        .float-btn { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); background: white; transition: 0.3s; }
        .float-btn img { width: 60%; }
        
        footer { background: #2c3e50; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>品牌名稱</h1>
    <p>連結亞洲資源，創造無限可能</p>
</header>

<section class="vision-section">
    <h2>我們的核心使命</h2>
    <p>我們致力於打破隔閡，透過精準的媒合機制，讓合作不再有距離。</p>
</section>

<div class="container">
    <section class="section">
        <h2>成功案例實錄</h2>
        <div class="case-grid">
            <div class="case-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="媒合會" class="case-img">
                <div class="case-content">
                    <h3>專業諮詢與媒合</h3>
                    <p>協助客戶精準篩選資源，縮短尋找合作對象的時間。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582213782179-e0d53f98a2ca?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="團隊討論" class="case-img">
                <div class="case-content">
                    <h3>跨國業務合作</h3>
                    <p>成功的跨國對接，實現亞洲市場的資源高效流通。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="結案握手" class="case-img">
                <div class="case-content">
                    <h3>長期穩定服務</h3>
                    <p>完善的售後支持與持續追蹤，確保每一份合作都有結果。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<div class="fixed-contact">
    <a href="https://lin.ee/zyXjA5K" target="_blank" class="float-btn" title="LINE 諮詢"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/LINE_logo.svg" alt="LINE"></a>
    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61590891923053" target="_blank" class="float-btn" title="查看 FB"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/2021_Facebook_icon.svg" alt="Facebook"></a>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 全台雲端媒合資訊站. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
